        "源文件与 tracked include 树 hash"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "环境变量优先级",
      "items": [
        "DG_JIT_* 优先,回落到 DJ_JIT_*(DeepJIT 全局)",
        "常用 DG_JIT_CACHE_DIR、DG_JIT_DEBUG、DG_JIT_DUMP_SASS",
        "查寄存器溢出用 DG_JIT_CHECK_NO_SPILLS"
